      "i_want": "employees who live in Germany and are subject to source tax to say whether they return daily to their home in Germany and, if they do, whether a certificate of residence (Ansässigkeitsbescheinigung) has been provided",
      "so_that": "the calculator can decide between the cross-border (Grenzgänger) tariff and the normal tariff",
      "priority": "P1",
      "priority_reason": "Without these answers the tariff of an employee living in Germany cannot be determined; HR names Germany residents (Konstanz) as a real case and cannot remember the German forms (F-hr_transcript-8595fb, F-hr_transcript-3f2c2a).",
